<title>UK: Romanian iron ore bulker refloated off Denmark.</title>
<headline>Romanian iron ore bulker refloated off Denmark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania-flag iron ore carrier Buzias was refloated Thursday with tug assistance after lightering its cargo, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said.</p>
<p>The 54,615-dwt bulker ran aground off Langeland Island, Denmark, on May 19.</p>
